#NEXUS

[ sallam2018a_fig3: Saltasaur tree with pies on every node, read with the image as it stands (root at left; the stem arrow is not a tip). The pale HPD bars cross the branches and are not branches. Two places where a parent's vertical carries two pies: the 0.11 node is (Saltasaurus+Neuquensaurus, Paralititan) and sits with the 0.12 (Diamantinasaurus, Maxakalisaurus) under the 0.05 pie; the 0.21 node is (Paludititan+Ampelosaurus, 0.02), the 0.02 node being ((Lohuecotitan, Mansourasaurus), 0.32). Picked case (pie charts on nodes; not a sample, not for accuracy estimates). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only; the pies, bars and support values are not encoded. 20 tips, 0 polytomies. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=20;
    TAXLABELS
        Saltasaurus
        Neuquensaurus
        Paralititan
        Diamantinasaurus
        Maxakalisaurus
        Futalognkosaurus
        Epachthosaurus
        Mendozasaurus
        Atsinganosaurus
        Pellegrinisaurus
        Alamosaurus
        Baurutitan
        Dreadnoughtus
        Paludititan
        Ampelosaurus
        Lohuecotitan
        Mansourasaurus
        Lirainosaurus
        Opisthocoelicaudia
        Nemegtosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE sallam2018a_fig3 = [&R] ((((Saltasaurus,Neuquensaurus),Paralititan),(Diamantinasaurus,Maxakalisaurus)),((Futalognkosaurus,(Epachthosaurus,(Mendozasaurus,Atsinganosaurus))),((Pellegrinisaurus,((Alamosaurus,Baurutitan),Dreadnoughtus)),((Paludititan,Ampelosaurus),((Lohuecotitan,Mansourasaurus),(Lirainosaurus,(Opisthocoelicaudia,Nemegtosaurus)))))));
END;
